          "6.23.0"
        ]
      },
      "rationale": "upload-artifact only transports diagnostics. Essential release verdicts use independent GitHub run/analysis APIs, readable SARIF and the audit digest obtained from run logs; signed release assets are produced locally and independently verified. Missing or mismatched evidence blocks."
